WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:38.867
An offline transfer and simulated bank selection; fictional data only.

2
00:00:38.967 --> 00:01:17.833
The demo simulates own-account, same-bank and other-bank transfers, with a test code and local receipts.

3
00:01:17.933 --> 00:01:56.800
Another scenario searches for and selects a recipient; it sends no transfer.

4
00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:35.767
The basic demo does not include all these advanced banking-interface steps.
